        <div class="tl-desc">Red-teaming, bias audits, capability evaluations, staged API rollout, and ongoing monitoring. For frontier models, this phase increasingly involves third-party auditors.</div>
        <span class="tl-duration">1 – 4 months</span>
      </div>
    </div>
